            <p>Employers are solely responsible for complying with all labour, employment, social security, wage, tax, occupational safety, and other statutory obligations arising from engagements with workers, unless Kaarigar has expressly agreed otherwise in a separate written contract.</p>
            <h3 id="sec-18">18. Payments</h3>
            <h4>18.1 Compensation</h4>
            <p>Employers are responsible for ensuring that workers receive the agreed compensation in accordance with the agreed terms and applicable law.</p>
            <h4>18.2 Platform Charges</h4>
            <p>Kaarigar may charge service fees, subscription fees, convenience fees, or other charges for access to certain Platform features. Such charges will be communicated before they become payable.</p>
