            <p>Where appropriate, Kaarigar may, at its discretion, facilitate communication or mediation, but is not obligated to adjudicate or guarantee payment.</p>
            <h3 id="sec-19">19. Ratings &amp; Reviews</h3>
            <p>Employers may rate and review workers after completion of an engagement.</p>
            <p>Ratings and reviews must:</p>
